{
  "type": "Collection",
  "id": "kontur/population-h3res8",
  "stac_version": "1.1.0",
  "description": "Kontur Population, 2022 release, on H3 resolution 8 hexagons (~0.74 km² each), world-wide. Each of the 32,589,553 populated cells carries an integer population count; uninhabited cells are absent. Kontur builds the grid by fusing the Global Human Settlement Layer, Meta's High Resolution Population Density Maps, Microsoft Building Footprints, Copernicus Global Land Cover and OpenStreetMap. Mirror of the CARTO Data Observatory dataset `demographics_population_glo_h3res8_v1_yearly_2022` (do_date 2022-01-01), republished as GeoParquet with the hexagon polygons derived from the H3 index, hive-partitioned by quadkey level 2 (`quadkey_prefix=*/*.parquet`).",
